/* 协议签署弹窗：色值/圆角一律引用 design-tokens 令牌（组件在 page 节点树内，可继承 page 令牌） */
.agree-mask {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  z-index: 12000;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
}

.agree-panel {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border-radius: var(--radius-card) var(--radius-card) 0 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* 清单模式自适应高度；阅读模式固定高度给 scroll-view 撑出滚动区 */
.agree-panel.is-list {
  max-height: 80vh;
}

.agree-panel.is-reader {
  height: 82vh;
}

.agree-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx 12rpx;
}

.agree-back {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
  margin-right: 16rpx;
  padding: 8rpx 0;
}

.agree-head-main {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.agree-title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-1);
}

.agree-sub {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
  margin-top: 6rpx;
}

.agree-progress {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.agree-list-scroll {
  max-height: 46vh;
  padding: 8rpx 32rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.agree-doc-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 24rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--border-light);
}

.agree-doc-row:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.agree-doc-name {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--text-1);
}

.agree-doc-more {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.agree-check {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 36rpx;
  height: 36rpx;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.agree-check.is-on {
  background: var(--brand);
  border-color: var(--brand);
}

.agree-check.is-on::after {
  content: '';
  width: 14rpx;
  height: 8rpx;
  border-left: 3rpx solid var(--text-anti);
  border-bottom: 3rpx solid var(--text-anti);
  transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(1rpx, -1rpx);
}

.agree-consent {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20rpx 32rpx;
}

.agree-consent .agree-check {
  margin-right: 16rpx;
}

.agree-consent-text {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.doc-scroll {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
}

.doc-content {
  padding: 8rpx 32rpx 32rpx;
}

.doc-para {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--text-2);
  text-align: justify;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}

.agree-foot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 8rpx 32rpx calc(24rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.agree-btn {
  flex: 1;
  height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
}

.agree-btn.is-primary {
  background: var(--brand);
  color: var(--text-anti);
}

.agree-btn.is-primary.is-disabled {
  background: var(--brand-light);
  color: var(--text-3);
}

.agree-btn.is-ghost {
  flex: 0 0 200rpx;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
  background: var(--bg-sunken);
  color: var(--text-2);
}
